            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The multioutput process "grass to digestion" describes a bio-refinery (grass-refinery) that delivers three co-products: biogas, proteins and fibres. Allocation for operation expenditures and emissions caused by the processing of grass has been performed by taking into account the revenues of the products. The above exchanges are allocated as follows: biogas: 16;
